        "created_at": "2014-06-18T21:18:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just played a game in which Fanatic, with 1HP, evoked End of Days. One of the cards she destroyed was an Explosives Wagon, which damages all targets when destroyed. Does the damage happen right then in the middle of resolving End of Days? And if so, does End of Days's effect end the moment Fanatic falls, removing all her cards from the board?</p>",
